From thomas.friedrichsmeier at ruhr-uni-bochum.de  Sat Jun 11 09:09:00 2011
From: thomas.friedrichsmeier at ruhr-uni-bochum.de (Thomas Friedrichsmeier)
Date: 11 Jun 2011 11:09:00 +0200
Subject: [rkward-users] possible warning
